cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Thymos in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "Thymos: A Local-First Engine Coupling Forgetting, Affect, Endocrine Modulation and Environment"
abstract: >-
  Thymos is a research sandbox that couples an FSRS-style forgetting curve,
  appraisal-based affect, an eight-variable endocrine layer, and weather/light
  coupling in one deterministic, inspectable state.
authors:
  - name: "Thymos contributors"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-12"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/agentforgehu/thymos-engine"
keywords:
  - affective computing
  - memory
  - forgetting curve
  - FSRS
  - ACT-R
  - endocrine
  - agent
